{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1402707-gangrel-antideluvian-location","id":1402707,"title":"Gangrel Antideluvian Location","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-13T18:09:06-07:00","id":1402707,"title":"Gangrel Antideluvian Location","content":"Is it suspected or known where she might be?<br /> <br /> I have a player who's character saw her in a memory and now knows what he wants to hunt most of all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-13T19:10:35-07:00","id":1402713,"title":"","content":"I believe the most common answers are that she is just roaming the wilds, sometimes sense by Gangrel that have melded with the earth she is passing through.<br /> <br /> From &quot;Gehenna,&quot; we have the theory that she Earth Melded with the planet's core, in order to become One with the Earth/Transcend her vampiric Curse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25886-kharnov","name":"Kharnov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"683"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-13T19:11:01-07:00","id":1402714,"title":"","content":"Nothing definitive. In one Gehenna story (before v20 and v5) she was one with the earth because of her extraordinary Protean. She was everywhere. She has been in Sumer. She's travelled far in the east too. You've a choice of any place--even your backyard. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24582-ruthven","name":"Ruthven","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"118"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-13T20:28:13-07:00","id":1402722,"title":"","content":"I think unless you're playing &quot;Crucible of God&quot; as an end times chronicle it's best not to have her/it be earth-melded with the <i>entire</i> planet. But it seems likely the Gangrel clan got its cultural tradition of wanderlust from its founder, and I like the idea of a mobile genius loci passing through the ground underfoot, only manifesting a physical body topside if her/its attention is attracted by something interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-13T20:35:30-07:00","id":1402724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1402707-gangrel-antideluvian-location?p=1402722#post1402722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think unless you're playing &quot;Crucible of God&quot; as an end times chronicle it's best not to have her/it be earth-melded with the <i>entire</i> planet. But it seems likely the Gangrel clan got its cultural tradition of wanderlust from its founder, and I like the idea of a mobile genius loci passing through the ground underfoot, only manifesting a physical body topside if her/its attention is attracted by something interesting.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's a thought. Enoia is on her way. All the gangrel of the city start freaking out and they don't know why until she is under them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-13T22:31:01-07:00","id":1402741,"title":"","content":"There was an instance pointing to Ennoia being in Africa, and an ancient Gangrel, that might have been Ennoia, awoke in the desert of I believe Mongolia. Nothing solid though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-14T10:05:58-07:00","id":1402819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kharnov</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1402707-gangrel-antideluvian-location?p=1402713#post1402713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I believe the most common answers are that she is just roaming the wilds, sometimes sense by Gangrel that have melded with the earth she is passing through.<br /> <br /> From &quot;Gehenna,&quot; we have the theory that she Earth Melded with the planet's core, in order to become One with the Earth/Transcend her vampiric Curse.</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine the Garou were not pleased.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-14T13:36:05-07:00","id":1402859,"title":"","content":"Wasn't there a theory that she was in the North Pole? Or was that the Nosferatu Antediluvian?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"d